//pin usage as follow:
//             CS  DC/RS  RESET  SDI/MOSI  SDO/MISO  SCK  LED    VCC     GND    
//Arduino Uno  A5   A3     A4      11        12      13   A0   5V/3.3V   GND
//ALBIE SAYS: you have to do all of these or it wolnt work.
